From 342bcf21c9ab8702d4ca0c9561c0727166c2adf9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 02:18:54 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/6] ISBI clean pipeline: harmonised preprocessing,
 moment-based CCT, leak-free eval, audit

- trace_seg3d: preprocessing (crop on raw brain mask, cube pad, 128^3, z-score in brain),
  fixed splits, MedNeXt with feature-moment context + AdaIN Counterfactual Context Transport,
  source-val-only calibration, per-case evaluation with HD95 in mm and audit signals,
  failure-detection audit (Spearman/AUROC/AURC), seed aggregation + Wilcoxon tables
- scripts/isbi: one-command experiment matrix, synthetic smoke test
- old loaders: crop before normalisation (crop was a no-op), background kept at 0
- _weighted_total: error on unknown loss terms, skip zero-weight terms

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01ALTy5wzfHPGHntHARSUcWz
